    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slitherise</strong> is a 2D physics-based action game where you guide a mysterious, snake-like creature to ascend through a dark, deep world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no save points \u2014 this game inherits the spirit of classic climbing games. Prepare yourself and rise to the challenge. (First-time playthrough: approximately 2+ hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using only intuitive mouse controls, the snake\u2019s movement feels unique, offering a \u201csimple yet profoundly deep\u201d gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, various gimmicks are designed to take full advantage of the snake's movement. Collect hidden fragments scattered across stages to gradually uncover the mysteries of this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slitherise</strong> is a fresh and memorable experience \u2014 simple to control, but truly challenging to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/2a2b5e7ccbd4d2754718c2c09f36351f.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 1: Unique mouse-only controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slitherise</strong>, you control the snake using only the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold to make the snake move toward the cursor \u2014 that's all you need to start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in this world, there\u2019s a catch: <i>the snake can barely move unless its body is touching the ground or walls</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls combined with realistic physics create a gameplay experience that is both simple and profoundly deep.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/100fcdb07ab391291c4842ce1ce85618.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 2: Various gimmicks and obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are packed with creative gimmicks that take full advantage of the snake's unique movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Moving lifts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Levers and handles that can be pulled by wrapping around them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pressure switches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Zero-gravity lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Blast jumps triggered by explosions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/d0fa26eb98f2e210e1c4335c0b8cbc5a.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 3: A bizarre and dark world &amp; story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visuals \u2014 black silhouettes against single-colored backgrounds \u2014 create a strange, dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set inside a massive, deep hole, scattered with wing-like fragments.<br>Each fragment unlocks a short pixel-art story animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By gathering these fragments, you'll gradually piece together the secrets of the world and discover why the snake is desperately trying to ascend.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slitherise</strong> is a 2D physics-based action game where you guide a mysterious, snake-like creature to ascend through a dark, deep world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no save points \u2014 this game inherits the spirit of classic climbing games. Prepare yourself and rise to the challenge. (First-time playthrough: approximately 2+ hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using only intuitive mouse controls, the snake\u2019s movement feels unique, offering a \u201csimple yet profoundly deep\u201d gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, various gimmicks are designed to take full advantage of the snake's movement. Collect hidden fragments scattered across stages to gradually uncover the mysteries of this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slitherise</strong> is a fresh and memorable experience \u2014 simple to control, but truly challenging to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/2a2b5e7ccbd4d2754718c2c09f36351f.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 1: Unique mouse-only controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slitherise</strong>, you control the snake using only the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold to make the snake move toward the cursor \u2014 that's all you need to start playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in this world, there\u2019s a catch: <i>the snake can barely move unless its body is touching the ground or walls</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls combined with realistic physics create a gameplay experience that is both simple and profoundly deep.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/100fcdb07ab391291c4842ce1ce85618.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 2: Various gimmicks and obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are packed with creative gimmicks that take full advantage of the snake's unique movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Moving lifts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Levers and handles that can be pulled by wrapping around them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pressure switches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Zero-gravity lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Blast jumps triggered by explosions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/d0fa26eb98f2e210e1c4335c0b8cbc5a.avif?t=1750996480\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature 3: A bizarre and dark world &amp; story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic visuals \u2014 black silhouettes against single-colored backgrounds \u2014 create a strange, dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set inside a massive, deep hole, scattered with wing-like fragments.<br>Each fragment unlocks a short pixel-art story animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By gathering these fragments, you'll gradually piece together the secrets of the world and discover why the snake is desperately trying to ascend.</p>",
    "short_description": "Simple controls, but serious challenge \u2014 a fresh climbing indie experience. Guide a mysterious snake as you ascend through a dark, deep world in this 2D physics-based action game: Slitherise.",
